      "message": "I created 2 functions for compart string array and ResolverParamsParcel.\n\nprivate void assertContainsString (String[] actual, String... expected) {\n    String[] sortedActual \u003d Arrays.copyOf(actual, actual.length);\n    Arrays.sort(sortedActual);\n    Arrays.sort(expected);\n    assertArrayEquals(expected, sortedActual);\n}\n\nI omit some fields that with default values.\nprivate void assertResolverEqual (ResolverParamsParcel actual, ResolverParamsParcel expected) {\n    assertEquals(actual.netId, expected.netId);\n    assertContainsString(actual.tlsServers, expected.tlsServers);\n    assertContainsExactly(actual.transportTypes, expected.transportTypes);\n}",
